・続けてhakase2_11</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-06T09:30:38" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>SWBELL
ベル</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-06T08:00:06" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#80ffff</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_t03_hakase2_11"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>アララギ『いんせき　ね▼</Text>
